        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Concrete block, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Concrete block, at plant
No losses and no waste water have been taken into account. The used concrete is "normal concrete";
UUID: 31d8dcab-ffc9-30c5-8a83-34a9b074514c
includes the raw material normal concrete which is poured into a mould, air-dryed and packed. Some transports and infrastructure are also included.
Location: For some exchanges CH-, RER-, and GLO-modules have been used as proxy
Technology: typical technology for German production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: See geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_31d8dcab-ffc9-30c5-8a83-34a9b074514c.xml</text>
